<title>POLAND: PROCHEM 96 NET RISES TO PLN 3.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>PROCHEM 96 NET RISES TO PLN 3.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.35 vs   0.72 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.73 vs   0.43 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.63 vs   0.33 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    6.74 vs   5.53</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.38 vs   2.08</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.75 vs   3.42</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.36 vs   0.43 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   46.01 vs  53.81</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish engineering company is Prochem</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
